# Everything in this repository is stored with LF endings, and checked out with
# LF endings on every platform.
#
# Prettier is configured with `endOfLine: "lf"` and `npm run format:check` runs
# on the Windows CI leg as well as the Linux ones. Letting Git rewrite line
# endings on checkout would make that check fail on Windows only, for a
# difference that exists nowhere in the committed files.
* text=auto eol=lf

